  m_text: 'Use your points to buy from the shop Area.

    Survive all rounds on
    a level to move on to the next level.

    Kill Enemy skulls to stop them from
    destroying your castle''s gate.

    Press P to pause

    Press q to use your
    grappling hook.

    Any unkilled enemies will reduce your score.

    Grab a
    torch to choose your difficulty level, with hard giving more points and causing
    the player to take double damage.'
